{"unit_id":"uckkk__dsh-video-creator#feature-1","repo":"uckkk/dsh-video-creator","commit":"09c893bfc061a018bc47a3b1567c1e852489f699","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"视频号创作助手 的功能「短视频脚本」：按主题、创作模板、目标平台、时长和补充要求生成内容包，包含主标题、备选标题、开头钩子、分镜脚本、发布简介、话题标签、封面文案与字幕。调用 script_generate。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:289-345"]}
{"unit_id":"uckkk__dsh-video-creator#feature-2","repo":"uckkk/dsh-video-creator","commit":"09c893bfc061a018bc47a3b1567c1e852489f699","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"视频号创作助手 的功能「平台发布方案」：将内容包适配为目标平台的标题、简介、标签和封面文案，并给出逐步手动发布指引；当前工具不执行平台上传。调用 publish。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:456-512"]}
{"unit_id":"uckkk__dsh-video-creator#feature-3","repo":"uckkk/dsh-video-creator","commit":"09c893bfc061a018bc47a3b1567c1e852489f699","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"视频号创作助手 的功能「发布素材打包」：把脚本、标题、标签、封面文案和字幕写入指定目录的 Markdown 或文本文件，并返回平台适配文案。调用 publish_package。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:404-454"]}
{"unit_id":"uckkk__dsh-video-creator#feature-4","repo":"uckkk/dsh-video-creator","commit":"09c893bfc061a018bc47a3b1567c1e852489f699","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"视频号创作助手 的功能「配音渲染成片」：读取内容包中的字幕或脚本，使用系统语音生成音频，再由 ffmpeg 合成带字幕的 MP4，可设置背景、分辨率和输出目录。调用 render_video。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:514-601"]}
{"unit_id":"uckkk__dsh-video-creator#caveat-1","repo":"uckkk/dsh-video-creator","commit":"09c893bfc061a018bc47a3b1567c1e852489f699","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"视频号创作助手 使用前须知：文本生成会把主题和生成提示发送到所配置的模型服务；需先配置文本模型 API 地址、Key 和模型名，配置写入本地 DSH 存储。见 lib/index.js:94-103、lib/index.js:64-68。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:64-68","lib/index.js:94-103"]}
{"unit_id":"uckkk__dsh-video-creator#caveat-2","repo":"uckkk/dsh-video-creator","commit":"09c893bfc061a018bc47a3b1567c1e852489f699","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"视频号创作助手 使用前须知：发布工具只整理文案和手动步骤，当前不会自动上传；成片渲染依赖 macOS say，视频模型生成则需单独配置。见 lib/index.js:456-512、lib/index.js:514-548。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:456-512","lib/index.js:514-548"]}
